    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="64afe244-abad-5b96-ba6b-fc4511c1fc88" activityNameId="26e4c55b-9f60-5631-aebd-9b1dfb99a14c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, medium voltage, supply mix GO, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, medium voltage, supply mix GO, at grid
This dataset describes the transformation from high to medium voltage as well as the transmission of electricity at medium voltage.; UUID:baf52276-8f3a-3683-b0df-77e80f0748dc
Included are the electricity production in Switzerland and from imports, the transmission network and direct SF6-emissions to air. Electricity losses during medium-voltage transmission and transformation from high-voltage are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers. Geographical classification according to IEA. Transmission network, losses and emissions are taken from Itten, Frischknecht and Stucki (2014): LCI of Electricity Mixes and Grid.
Technology: Average technology used to transmit and distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines, as well as air-, vacuum- and SF6-insulated high-to-medium voltage switching stations. Electricity production according to related datasets
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistical data
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_baf52276-8f3a-3683-b0df-77e80f0748dc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
